title: The 13th Bell
id: the-13th-bell
lang: en
voice: young_storyteller

cast:
me      kid   messy #5a3a22    | hoodie #3f8f5a #2f6e45 | pants #2d3b55
lily    kid   ponytail #b5482e | polka #f6a6c4 #ffffff  | skirt #f6a6c4
grandpa elder bald #dddddd     | cardigan #8a5a3c #f2efe6 | pants #6b6b6b | glasses beard
mayor   adult short #2a2a2a    | suit #1f2f5c #ffffff   | pants #1f2f5c | tie mayor_chain

== church_front night
In our town, the church | est push
bell rings 13 times at midnight. | low push
== bedroom night
Not 12. 13. | cu me:surprised
== street night
Everybody counts. | est crowd:10:neutral>church
== house_front night
Nobody asks why. | two extra1:neutral extra2:neutral
== church_front night
Same bell. Same tower. | est push
== bedroom night
Same 13. | cu lily:smile
== living_room night
Grandpa watches the tower every night | med grandpa:binoculars>window
== church_front night
through his old binoculars. | est bino
== living_room night
He says the 13th ring is | cu grandpa:talk push
== road_night night
for whoever didn't make it home. | est drift
== bedroom night
My little sister Lily | med lily:wave:grin
counts from her bedroom window. | ots lily >window
When the bell stops, she blinks | mcu lily:carry:smile:flashlight
her flashlight 13 times back at the tower. | ots lily:carry:flashlight >across
Like a goodnight. | cu lily:happy push
== church_front night
One night, the bell rang 14 times. | low shake
== bedroom night
Lily blinked 14 times. | mcu lily:carry:worried:flashlight
== living_room night
Grandpa lowered his binoculars | med grandpa:look_down:worried:binoculars
and didn't say a word. | cu grandpa:sad push
== house_front day
The next morning, Mr Hale's house | est push
was empty. | wide push
== street day
Nobody saw him leave. | est crowd:8:worried>house
The mayor said | med mayor:talk:smile
Mr Hale moved away. | cu mayor:smirk push
Nobody asked where. | est crowd:10:look_down:sad
== church_front night
The next night, 15 rings. | est push
== kitchen day
The baker was gone. | wide drift
== church_front night
Then 16. | low shake
== park day
The whole Miller family. | est drift
== street night
People stopped counting. | est crowd:10:scared
== road_night night
They shut their curtains before midnight. | est push
== living_room night
Grandpa didn't. | med grandpa:angry push
He sat by the fire with his stopwatch. | med grandpa:sit:stopwatch@armchair
"Count with me," he whispered. | two grandpa:talk>me me:worried>grandpa q:grandpa
"If you stop counting, it counts you." | cu grandpa:scared push q:grandpa
== church_front night
Last night, the bell rang | low shake
== bedroom night
30 times. | cu me:scared push
I counted every single one. | med me:sit:worried@bed
== living_room night
Grandpa's chair is empty now. | wide push
== bedroom night
Lily has his binoculars. | mcu lily:binoculars
She still sits at her window every night. | ots lily:binoculars >window
== church_front night
But she doesn't watch the tower anymore. | est bino
== bedroom night
She watches me. | cu lily:binoculars push
And she's counting. | med me:scared bino push
